  "details": "Version: 2020.1.1p1 (916)\nIt started happening with 2020.1.1(912)\nDescription of the bug:\nCertain prefabs such as ExMenu have a script that triggers when the user opens the VRChat menu. Starting with VRChat 2020.1.1, on Index (Knuckles) Controllers, jumping will trigger this behavior. As far as I can tell, the menu button will trigger it until the first jump, then the menu button will no longer trigger it. The issue is not present in desktop mode or when using Vive wands. ExMenu is one example but apparently other custom worlds like dancedanceVR are experiencing the same issue.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nWith Index controllers, enter a world with ExMenu (such as NeoShibuyaDay), and jump. The ExMenu will open.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): N/A",
